====================================================
EA IDENTITY
====================================================
Name: CamboSMCore
Version: 2.41 (must appear in header and code)

====================================================
CHART & SYMBOL RULES (STRICT)
====================================================
- EA MUST be attached to M15 chart ONLY
- EA MUST support any XAUUSD symbol variant:
  XAUUSD, XAUUSDm, XAUUSD.r, XAUUSDpro, etc
- Reject all other symbols/timeframes with clear error

====================================================
TIMEFRAME ROLES (DO NOT MIX)
====================================================
H4  → market bias
H1  → bias confirmation
M15 → setup (pullback + scoring)
M5  → ENTRY CONFIRMATION ONLY (timing)

EA is attached to M15.  
M5 is read internally only.

====================================================
INDICATORS
====================================================
H4:
- EMA 50
- EMA 200

H1:
- EMA 50
- EMA 100

M15:
- EMA 20
- EMA 50
- EMA 100
- ADX(14)
- RSI(14)
- ATR(14)

M5:
- NO indicators
- Use candle OHLC only

====================================================
TRADE DIRECTION MODE
====================================================
Input enum:
- BUY_ONLY
- SELL_ONLY
- BOTH

====================================================
DAILY EXTREMES FILTER (MANDATORY)
====================================================
BUY blocked if:
(CurrentAsk - DayLow) >= InpMaxBuyDistanceFromDayLow_USD

SELL blocked if:
(DayHigh - CurrentBid) >= InpMaxSellDistanceFromDayHigh_USD

If blocked:
- Score forced to 0
- Pending setup cancelled immediately

====================================================
HTF BIAS GATE (HARD FILTER)
====================================================
BUY allowed only if:
- H4 EMA50 > EMA200 AND close > EMA50
- H1 EMA50 > EMA100 AND close > EMA50

SELL allowed only if:
- H4 EMA50 < EMA200 AND close < EMA50
- H1 EMA50 < EMA100 AND close < EMA50

====================================================
STANDARD PULLBACK (STRICT)
====================================================
Uses CLOSED M15 candles only.

Pullback candle = M15 index 2  
Confirmation candle = M15 index 1

BUY pullback:
- Low touches EMA20 or EMA50
- Close remains above EMA50
- Body ≤ 60% of range

SELL pullback:
- High touches EMA20 or EMA50
- Close remains below EMA50
- Body ≤ 60% of range

Confirmation candle:
- Strong body ≥ 60%
- Small rejection wick ≤ 25%
- Close above EMA20 (BUY) / below EMA20 (SELL)

====================================================
AI SCORE SYSTEM (UNCHANGED)
====================================================
Keep existing scoring logic exactly:
- HTF
- M15 structure
- EMA spread
- ADX / ATR / RSI
- Pullback quality
- Confirmation quality

Trade only if score ≥ InpMinScoreToTrade.

====================================================
WAITING PHASE & M5 ENTRY CONFIRMATION (CRITICAL FIX)
====================================================
After valid M15 setup:
- Mark setup as PENDING
- DO NOT ENTER yet

----------------------------------------------------
M5 CONFIRMATION (ACCEPTANCE)
----------------------------------------------------
Wait for a CLOSED M5 candle.

BUY:
- M5 CLOSE > (M15 confirmation HIGH + buffer)
- Candle bullish
- Body ≥ 50% of range

SELL:
- M5 CLOSE < (M15 confirmation LOW − buffer)
- Candle bearish
- Body ≥ 50% of range

----------------------------------------------------
ENTRY EXECUTION (IMPORTANT FIX)
----------------------------------------------------
- Entry uses MARKET order at M5 candle CLOSE price
- NO pending orders
- NO tick-based entry
- ONE attempt per setup

----------------------------------------------------
CRITICAL RISK FIX (MANDATORY)
----------------------------------------------------
InitialRisk MUST be recalculated AT ENTRY using:
- BUY: entryPrice − stopLoss
- SELL: stopLoss − entryPrice

DO NOT use trigger price for risk calculation.

This risk value MUST be:
- Stored in trade comment
- Used for TP, breakeven, trailing

====================================================
SETUP EXPIRY
====================================================
- Setup expires after 3 M15 candles
- If expired → cancel pending setup

====================================================
STOP LOSS (STRUCTURE-BASED)
====================================================
BUY:
- SL = pullback candle LOW − buffer

SELL:
- SL = pullback candle HIGH + buffer

Validate SL:
- Min = 3 USD
- Max = 12 USD
- If invalid → skip trade

NEVER widen SL.

====================================================
TAKE PROFIT
====================================================
TP = InitialRisk × RR (default RR = 1.8)

====================================================
BREAKEVEN & TRAILING (R-BASED)
====================================================
Breakeven:
- Trigger at 1.0R
- Move SL slightly positive

Trailing:
- Start at 1.2R
- Distance = 0.8R
- NEVER loosen SL

====================================================
TRADE & EQUITY CONTROL
====================================================
- Max 1 trade per day
- Max 1 open position
- Magic-number isolated
- Daily DD = 3%
- Max DD = 8%
- Block trading when hit

====================================================
TECHNICAL FIXES (MANDATORY)
====================================================
- Validate ALL CopyBuffer() return values
- Do NOT use uninitialized arrays
- Use symbol-based PositionModify (safe overload)
- Normalize prices with _Digits
- Respect stop & freeze levels
- Release all indicator handles

====================================================
LOGGING (MANDATORY)
====================================================
Log:
- Setup creation
- Score details
- M5 confirmation success/failure
- Setup expiry
- Entry execution
- Risk (R) used
- Equity blocks

